sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant W1 as Worker A
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant P as Provider service
  participant W2 as Worker B

  W1->>DB: Claim submitting_create + fencing token 7
  DB-->>W1: Lease until T + stable operation ID
  W1->>P: SubmitCreateInstance request ID operation:create
  P-->>W1: Accepted + resource ID + task reference

  alt Checkpoint commit succeeds
    W1->>DB: Save polling_create + task reference under token 7
    DB-->>W1: Commit and release lease
  else Worker or database fails before checkpoint
    Note over W1,DB: No terminal failure is written from an uncertain checkpoint.
    DB->>DB: Lease expires
    W2->>DB: Claim submitting_create + fencing token 8
    W2->>P: Replay identical request ID operation:create
    P-->>W2: Same resource and task, no second resource
    W2->>DB: Save polling_create under token 8
    W1-xDB: Late token 7 checkpoint is fenced
  end

  alt Mutation transport times out
    W2->>P: Configure or start with stable request ID
    P--xW2: Deadline or unavailable, outcome unknown
    W2->>DB: Complete as manual_review
    Note over W2,DB: No automatic destructive compensation or blind resubmission.
  else Read-only task poll is unavailable
    W2->>P: GetTask
    P--xW2: Unavailable
    W2->>DB: Save retry_wait with bounded delay
  end
